1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,551
Ten years ago, Alex and Maya each started with ten thousand dollars in savings.

2
00:00:05,731 --> 00:00:12,455
Alex locked his cash inside a traditional bank account, while Maya converted hers into gold and real assets.

3
00:00:12,635 --> 00:00:20,646
After a decade of compounding inflation, Alex's bank balance looked bigger on paper at fourteen thousand eight hundred dollars.

4
00:00:20,826 --> 00:00:26,643
But in real purchasing power, inflation quietly melted more than half of his money away!

5
00:00:26,823 --> 00:00:31,931
Meanwhile, panicked traders who chased market hype at the peak got trapped when the bubble burst.

6
00:00:32,111 --> 00:00:39,710
Maya stayed calm and bought in three disciplined steps, growing her real wealth to over forty-two thousand dollars!

7
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:47,554
Remember three golden rules: keep six months of emergency cash, convert long-term savings into scarce assets,

8
00:00:47,734 --> 00:00:52,202
and never buy at the peak of market euphoria. Built with ToonFlow version one.
